p a matching or empty tube.":"撳任何一個管，然後撳一個匹配或者空嘅管。","Colors must match":"顏色必須匹配","An orb can only land on an empty tube or on an orb of the same color. Watch what happens when you try otherwise.":"球只能夠跌落空管或者相同顏色嘅球上面。試吓唔同嘅做法，睇吓會發生咩事。","Try pouring onto a different color — the gallery will explain.":"試下倒喺唔同顏色上面 — 圖庫會解釋。","Tubes have limits":"管都有限制","A full tube cannot accept more orbs. Fill a tube and see.":"一條滿咗嘅管唔可以再放更多球。填滿一條管試吓。","Keep playing — notice when a tube cannot take more.":"繼續玩 — 注意幾時一個管唔可以攞多啲。","Second thoughts":"第二個諗法","Made a move you regret? Use Undo (U key or the Undo action) to take it back.":"做咗個動作你後悔？用復原（ U 鍵或者復原動作）攞返佢。","Make any move, then press Undo.":"做任何動作，然後撳復原。","One color per tube":"每管一種顏色","Win by sorting so every tube holds a single color. Finish this board!":"用分類嚟贏，噉樣每個管都保持單一顏色。完成呢個板！","Consolidate colors until every tube is pure.":"合併顏色，直到每支試管都係純色。","First Light Caught":"第一盞燈捉到","Complete your first board.":"完成你嘅第一個棋盤。","Tube Master":"管大師","Complete 10 journey stages.":"完成 10 個旅程關卡。","Three Dawns Running":"三個黎明跑","Complete the daily challenge 3 days in a row.":"連續 3 日完成每日挑戰。","Crowded Wing Cleared":"擠迫嘅翼已清空","Complete the Crowded Wing challenge.":"完成 Crowded Wing 挑戰。","Gallery Regular":"畫廊常客","Complete 50 boards in total.":"總共完成 50 個棋盤。","Open Options":"開啟選項","Music, effects and mute, graphics quality, language, larger text, high contrast and reduced motion are in the StarHermit Options.":"音樂、音效同靜音、畫質、語言、放大文字、高對比同減少動態效果，都喺 StarHermit 選項入面。","Key bindings":"按鍵設定","Keys and gamepad buttons are rebound in the StarHermit Options.":"按鍵與手掣按鈕可在 StarHermit 選項中重新綁定。","Progress synced from your account.":"進度已從你的帳戶同步。"}
